      "section_id": "the-diagnostic-questions",
      "quote": "Is this an architectural gap? Does the system lack the capability it needs? If the agent hallucinates ticket IDs because it doesn't have access to the ticket database, no prompt change will fix that. The system needs a new tool or data source."
